Still: combine native address controls and grouped tabs in one left island.

Join the native toolbar and expanded vertical tabs above the stable page viewport.
Center the content-sized island vertically, cap it to the window, and use one
hover reveal animation. Keep keyboard, address editing and menu interactions
accessible without pinning mouse-clicked controls. Preserve native caption
controls, permission/omnibox anchors, content-fullscreen and page dialog bounds.
All changes are browser Views presentation and UI preference defaults.

